      "content": "The \"existing use\" argument seems solid, but the neighbor's property has a small structure that's technically encroaching over the property line into our client's lot. According to some of the local ordinances, this might be classified as a \"non-conforming encroachment.\" How does the presence of an external encroachment like that impact the feasibility of the mixed-use reclassification?",
